[{"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/1_0.wav", "text": "你在这段视频里看到的所有内容，都是我在睡觉时由我的克劳德代码系统编辑完成的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/2_0.wav", "text": "每一个剪辑，每一个音效，每一个动画，就像这个，这个，还有这个。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/3_0.wav", "text": "全都是在没碰时间轴的情况下完成的。不，我不会写代码。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/4_0.wav", "text": "所以今天我就要揭开谜底，向你展示我究竟是怎么打造出这个专家级剪辑器的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/5_0.wav", "text": "一步步来，用什么工具？怎么设置？怎么教会他我的剪辑风格？"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/6_0.wav", "text": "还有确切的花费，以及我每月到底省下了几千美元。开始吧。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/7_0.wav", "text": "好，以前要做出像这样的视频，得靠一个小团队。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/8_0.wav", "text": "说清楚点，我现在还得负责一件事：开拍，还有给出反馈。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/9_0.wav", "text": "但在我的系统里，其他所有活儿都交给了不同的工具。所以接下来我会一个一个的给你拆解。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/10_0.wav", "text": "现在，第一个就是剪辑器。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/11_0.wav", "text": "这人就是会守在时间线前好几个小时的人。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/12_0.wav", "text": "他们看完每一段素材，挑出喜欢的，再把不喜欢的剪掉。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/13_0.wav", "text": "决定好每一次缩放的位置，还想好要加什么画面和动画，以及加在哪儿。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/14_0.wav", "text": "在我的系统里，克劳德代码就是干这些事的工具。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/15_0.wav", "text": "你可以把它当成整个视频的项目经理。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/16_0.wav", "text": "我用的是克劳德的桌面版，用起来完全没问题。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/17_0.wav", "text": "克劳德代码还能在本地运行，也就是说，他直接用我的电脑干活。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/18_0.wav", "text": "它能访问文件，能调用其他程序，最后还能把输出结果。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/19_0.wav", "text": "放到我电脑的一个文件夹里。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/20_0.wav", "text": "这其实很重要，因为克劳德才是这里所有其他工具的协调者。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/21_0.wav", "text": "但有个问题：克劳德根本听不到我的视频声音。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/22_0.wav", "text": "那他怎么知道我说了什么，哪儿出错了？好把整个视频剪出来呢？"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/23_0.wav", "text": "这就是我们清单上的第二份工作，也就是转录员的工作。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/24_0.wav", "text": "这个人要听完所有素材，再把内容转换成文字。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/25_0.wav", "text": "并加上时间戳。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/26_0.wav", "text": "实现这个功能的工具叫帕拉吉特。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/27_0.wav", "text": "这是个完全免费的工具，由芯片行业的领先制造商英伟达开发。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/28_0.wav", "text": "不，不是多利多资获乐事，我指的是给 AI 用的那种芯片。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/29_0.wav", "text": "嗯，信片。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/30_0.wav", "text": "说回正题。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/31_0.wav", "text": "所以帕拉吉特负责转路，然后克劳德就能真正读取时间戳。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/32_0.wav", "text": "以及具体说了什么，接着就能把这些信息用到流程的下一步。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/33_0.wav", "text": "我们就是这么识别，并切分素材，确保拿到正确的镜头。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/34_0.wav", "text": "第三个工作其实是动画师。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/35_0.wav", "text": "这个人要做出每一个标题。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/36_0.wav", "text": "每一个弹出的标志，还有所有动态图形。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/37_0.wav", "text": "以前，这都靠阿夫特伊费克茨。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/38_0.wav", "text": "你真就得只用一个工具来做这些事。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/39_0.wav", "text": "而这时，海珀真就派上用场了，也就是第三个工具。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/40_0.wav", "text": "这又是一个免费工具，由视频平台海真开发。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/41_0.wav", "text": "克劳德把每个动画都写成一个小网站，然后海珀真把它转成四K视频。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/42_0.wav", "text": "所以现在东华在大电视上看着也很清晰。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/43_0.wav", "text": "全在我自己的电脑上运行，所以其实不花我一分钱。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/44_0.wav", "text": "不过，视频里我有时会说：“像欧鹏哎，爱刚宣布了云云这种话。”"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/45_0.wav", "text": "说这话时，我其实需要第四个人，也就是研究员。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/46_0.wav", "text": "就是那个能去找到相关公告截图或帖子的人。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/47_0.wav", "text": "在 X 上，或是在能证明我正说明的观点的研究论文里。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/48_0.wav", "text": "再把那些东西转成我们说的 B 肉。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/49_0.wav", "text": "就是叠在视频上播放的那些外景素材。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/50_0.wav", "text": "而干这个的，其实我们每个人的笔记本电脑里都有，就是浏览器。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/51_0.wav", "text": "所以呢，我用的是谷歌浏览器。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/52_0.wav", "text": "然后克劳德就能直接用浏览器去网上做研究。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/53_0.wav", "text": "同时，在后台，克劳德（也就是我的研究员）就能截图。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/54_0.wav", "text": "或者录下网页往下滑的视频。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/55_0.wav", "text": "它还能高亮某些行。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/56_0.wav", "text": "或者直接放大页面的特定部分。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/57_0.wav", "text": "最棒的是，他只给你看确切的事实。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/58_0.wav", "text": "也就是说，他会直接抓取原始的 X 片子或网页本身。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/59_0.wav", "text": "所以我只要说发生了什么，证据就会直接出现在屏幕上。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/60_0.wav", "text": "现在第五个任务是屏幕剪辑。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/61_0.wav", "text": "这主要是因为我特爱做点简单的教程。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/62_0.wav", "text": "教大家怎么用 AI 工具，怎么用它们赚钱。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/63_0.wav", "text": "但我经常要共享屏幕。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/64_0.wav", "text": "所以我才用了一个叫“泰拉”的工具。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/65_0.wav", "text": "台拉能同时录下我的脸和我的屏幕。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/66_0.wav", "text": "而且因为泰拉有个叫 MCP 的连接器。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/67_0.wav", "text": "我就能把它直接连到克劳德代码里。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/68_0.wav", "text": "然后他就能在软件里完成所有能做的事。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/69_0.wav", "text": "剪辑、缩放、布局、排版等等。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/70_0.wav", "text": "这软件里能做的所有事，你都能通过克劳德代码来做。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/71_0.wav", "text": "所以我真的只要录一遍，剩下的就全交给他了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/72_0.wav", "text": "不过到目前为止，我们聊的都是这个视频的视觉效果。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/73_0.wav", "text": "每个顶尖的视频团队都有我们所说的声音设计师。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/74_0.wav", "text": "这个人负责决定每段片段配什么音乐。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/75_0.wav", "text": "特定情节出现时，加什么音效？"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/76_0.wav", "text": "并确保这些内容符合品牌调性。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/77_0.wav", "text": "因为你肯定不希望在讲教程的时候。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/78_0.wav", "text": "用到的音乐风格却让人昏昏欲睡。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/79_0.wav", "text": "所以这次我用了一个叫《爱皮大米克桑德》的声音库。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/80_0.wav", "text": "这得花钱买。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/81_0.wav", "text": "最后再说价格。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/82_0.wav", "text": "我还能把它连到克劳德。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/83_0.wav", "text": "然后他就能出去搜声音。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/84_0.wav", "text": "最酷的是，我能按自己的喜好来调教它。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/85_0.wav", "text": "我一般喜欢让开头那段带点悬念。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/86_0.wav", "text": "接着就切到那种挺轻快的音乐，有点像低保真嘻哈。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/87_0.wav", "text": "再把音量压得特别低。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/88_0.wav", "text": "所以嘛，音效也有他自己的规矩。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/89_0.wav", "text": "等会儿我就讲讲这些，我都怎么设的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/90_0.wav", "text": "现在团队的第七个成员其实是收尾的人。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/91_0.wav", "text": "这人负责把所有片段拼到一起，再检查一遍有没有出错。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/92_0.wav", "text": "这个工具叫FFMP。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/93_0.wav", "text": "他免费，而且剪视频已经二十多年了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/94_0.wav", "text": "事实上，现在市面上几乎所有剪辑软件背后用的都是它。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/95_0.wav", "text": "所以克劳德就用它来剪掉所有黑屏。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/96_0.wav", "text": "在我看到视频之前，得先确认音频同步没问题。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/97_0.wav", "text": "以上就是必须完成的七种工具和工作。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/98_0.wav", "text": "但他们根本不知道我的视频到底该是什么样子。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/99_0.wav", "text": "这大概才是最重要的，也就是所谓的技巧。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/100_0.wav", "text": "技巧其实就是一个指令文件。克劳德干活前会先读取它。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/101_0.wav", "text": "这基本就是我的剪辑风格，拆解成了具体细节。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/102_0.wav", "text": "颜色、字体、动画、音效。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/103_0.wav", "text": "还有一大堆，基本上就是我的偏好的细节。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/104_0.wav", "text": "我的这个叫优图剪辑，大概有一千四百行。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/105_0.wav", "text": "但最棒的是，克劳德代码居然帮我建好了这一整套东西。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/106_0.wav", "text": "所以基本上就是克劳德运行所有工具，然后我再告诉克劳德什么样才算好。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/107_0.wav", "text": "现在我不是搞技术的，你大概也不是，所以我这就给你演示一下，到底该怎么设置，真的超简单。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/108_0.wav", "text": "好，那设置的第一步就是下载克劳德。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/109_0.wav", "text": "你可以去安斯罗匹克的网站下载那个桌面应用。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/110_0.wav", "text": "我推荐的就是它。我自己用的也是它。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/111_0.wav", "text": "装好之后，它就会让你创建账户。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/112_0.wav", "text": "你得用谷歌账号或者用户名和密码来创建。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/113_0.wav", "text": "要是你第一次下载克劳德，他会自动帮你配置好。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/114_0.wav", "text": "我建议你把这个流程走一遍。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/115_0.wav", "text": "我还有个完整的视频，专门讲怎么正确配置。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/116_0.wav", "text": "不过，这儿其实用不着那个。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/117_0.wav", "text": "现在用这个功能，你得有个付费套餐。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/118_0.wav", "text": "我会升级到二十美元那个套餐。目前没必要选比它更高的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/119_0.wav", "text": "进到主界面后，大概就是这个样子。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/120_0.wav", "text": "可能看着会有点不一样，因为东西总在变。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/121_0.wav", "text": "不过，基本上你只要点新建。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/122_0.wav", "text": "就能在克劳德里开一个新绘画。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/123_0.wav", "text": "现在左边这是克劳德，也就是普通版，能聊天也能协作。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/124_0.wav", "text": "然后，这儿是克劳德代码。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/125_0.wav", "text": "所以这个，你得用克洛的代码。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/126_0.wav", "text": "接着，在继续之前，你还得完成几个设置步骤。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/127_0.wav", "text": "首先，你得确保用的是本地模式。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/128_0.wav", "text": "也就是用你自己的电脑来处理。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/129_0.wav", "text": "接下来，你得确定好你要操作的那个文件夹。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/130_0.wav", "text": "这个的话，直接点这儿就行。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/131_0.wav", "text": "如你所见，我已经连上了我的克劳德代码文件夹。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/132_0.wav", "text": "但你基本上可以点这个，然后添加一个全新的文件夹。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/133_0.wav", "text": "你可以在这里建一个，然后再把它关联上。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/134_0.wav", "text": "之后，你要把权限改成自动模式。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/135_0.wav", "text": "这样它就能运行。你也不用对成千上万件事来回电是否了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/136_0.wav", "text": "然后你要把模型换成最新的其中一个。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/137_0.wav", "text": "就因为设置这一步很重要。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/138_0.wav", "text": "之后，它就能用更便宜的模型运行了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/139_0.wav", "text": "最后，你压到左边这里来，然后进到设置里。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/140_0.wav", "text": "你要进到克劳德代码。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/141_0.wav", "text": "然后这儿，你可以直接复制我这里的设置。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/142_0.wav", "text": "或者你也可以直接决定打开。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/143_0.wav", "text": "有一项对我们上网来说特别重要的设置。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/144_0.wav", "text": "就是把它打开，就在这儿操作。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/145_0.wav", "text": "弄好后，你基本可以关掉这个窗口，返回主菜单，点新建。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/146_0.wav", "text": "然后，克劳德代码自己就能很轻松的把这些都设置好。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/147_0.wav", "text": "所以这次我就给他一段这样的提示。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/148_0.wav", "text": "能帮我创建一个视频剪辑系统吗？"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/149_0.wav", "text": "我想在这个系统里用海珀珍、FMP、泰拉和艾皮戴米克桑德。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/150_0.wav", "text": "一步步教我该怎么把它设置好。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/151_0.wav", "text": "所以一种方法就是直接让他一步步带你完成整个过程。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/152_0.wav", "text": "那另一种做法呢？"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/153_0.wav", "text": "克劳德应该能下载并安装他需要的所有东西。他完全可以做到。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/154_0.wav", "text": "他还会要求你实际连接上其中几个工具。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/155_0.wav", "text": "你来到左边这里，然后点自定义。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/156_0.wav", "text": "再点连接器。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/157_0.wav", "text": "然后你基本上就能选工具了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/158_0.wav", "text": "所以这次呢，我来找找泰拉。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/159_0.wav", "text": "也就是我的屏幕录制设备。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/160_0.wav", "text": "如你所见，我已经连上他了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/161_0.wav", "text": "不行的话，直接点那儿那个加号就行。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/162_0.wav", "text": "至于 IP 大米，X 三都也是一样的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/163_0.wav", "text": "找找 IP 带米克桑德。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/164_0.wav", "text": "那么就是这个是音乐和营销。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/165_0.wav", "text": "直接把它打开就行。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/166_0.wav", "text": "它会让你换个浏览器登录。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/167_0.wav", "text": "登录完，你就会看到这个对勾。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/168_0.wav", "text": "现在，他需要的其他东西都会自己下载。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/169_0.wav", "text": "但如果他因为任何原因找不到海珀针。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/170_0.wav", "text": "你直接谷歌海豹真就行。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/171_0.wav", "text": "你会找到仓库的链接。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/172_0.wav", "text": "不过，在连接器里也能找到海珀针。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/173_0.wav", "text": "现在把这些都连好后。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/174_0.wav", "text": "你要确保他把这些东西作为技能保存在你的电脑上。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/175_0.wav", "text": "等它真正保存在那一个聊天或对话现成里之后。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/176_0.wav", "text": "你就得开一个新县城，给他做个初步测试。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/177_0.wav", "text": "现在，如你所见，设置这些东西其实很简单。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/178_0.wav", "text": "真正花时间的是把外观和感觉都微调到位。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/179_0.wav", "text": "如果你想直接下载我的技能来用。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/180_0.wav", "text": "随时可以在我的免费社区里操作。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/181_0.wav", "text": "链接在下面。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/182_0.wav", "text": "不过现在，咱们直接看我到底是怎么教他的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/183_0.wav", "text": "嗯，一开始我做的每样东西几乎都给他备注了说明。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/184_0.wav", "text": "我先从短片段开始，通常只截视频最吸引人的那部分。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/185_0.wav", "text": "等他给出初稿后。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/186_0.wav", "text": "我基本上都会给出带时间戳的非常具体的反馈。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/187_0.wav", "text": "针对他完成的工作。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/188_0.wav", "text": "十天后，我直接拿其中一个片头。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/189_0.wav", "text": "开始给它配上声音。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/190_0.wav", "text": "我得在一个片头上试好多不同的音效。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/191_0.wav", "text": "我得试过大概八到十种不同的声音。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/192_0.wav", "text": "直到找到真正适合我口味的那个。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/193_0.wav", "text": "因为它生成的效果对我来说有点太杂了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/194_0.wav", "text": "所以这个主要是用来做音效的，对吧？"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/195_0.wav", "text": "有东西弹出来的时候，可以配个“砰”的小声。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/196_0.wav", "text": "有人点击的时候，可以配个小小的点击声。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/197_0.wav", "text": "等他开始决定要怎么用。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/198_0.wav", "text": "我给他的那些不同声音时。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/199_0.wav", "text": "我基本上就跟他说：“行，把这个声音调小点。”"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/200_0.wav", "text": "好吧，我觉得这个声音我一点都不喜欢。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/201_0.wav", "text": "直接把它完全去掉。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/202_0.wav", "text": "然后他就这么一点点地学会了我的喜好。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/203_0.wav", "text": "现在，这才是整个流程的关键。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/204_0.wav", "text": "等你真的给了他反馈，在那之后。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/205_0.wav", "text": "你就让他把学到的东西存到技能本身里去。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/206_0.wav", "text": "这样，每次新建剪辑时。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/207_0.wav", "text": "你的剪辑系统就会不断进步。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/208_0.wav", "text": "接着，我开了一个新绘画，用上了这个更新后的技能。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/209_0.wav", "text": "然后我又加上了另一个钩子。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/210_0.wav", "text": "这回我很满意，他居然自己去取了一个特定的徽标。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/211_0.wav", "text": "还用音效把它表现了出来。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/212_0.wav", "text": "但我希望它显示的再大一点。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/213_0.wav", "text": "我也不太喜欢他。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/214_0.wav", "text": "在某些段落或动画里，用的那套配色。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/215_0.wav", "text": "所以就决定稍微换一换。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/216_0.wav", "text": "后来我做的视频越多，给的反馈越多，效果就越好。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/217_0.wav", "text": "现在我的这套技能有三十六条必须遵守的规则。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/218_0.wav", "text": "再后来，我发现了一些特别酷的动画效果。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/219_0.wav", "text": "就开始琢磨哪些效果合适。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/220_0.wav", "text": "能配得上我实际做出来的内容。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/221_0.wav", "text": "就这么慢慢加多了这些。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/222_0.wav", "text": "每用一次，我就微调一次。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/223_0.wav", "text": "最棒的是，我给他的每一条备注。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/224_0.wav", "text": "下次他都再没犯过同样的错。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/225_0.wav", "text": "也就是说，我基本能得到完全符合预期的输出。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/226_0.wav", "text": "正是我想要的那种。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/227_0.wav", "text": "好了，各位不说了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/228_0.wav", "text": "我来给你们实际演示一下。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/229_0.wav", "text": "好，我们现在又回到了克劳德代码里。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/230_0.wav", "text": "既然我已经创建好了这个技能，或者说它的第一版。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/231_0.wav", "text": "我随时都能让他跑起来。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/232_0.wav", "text": "我来这儿。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/233_0.wav", "text": "我主要是要加个原始文件。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/234_0.wav", "text": "能，这儿有个我今天早些时候录的片头。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/235_0.wav", "text": "就是给这个视频用的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/236_0.wav", "text": "我现在就把它打开。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/237_0.wav", "text": "然后我要这么跟他说。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/238_0.wav", "text": "用我的优兔剪辑技巧，为我的优兔视频剪辑这个片头。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/239_0.wav", "text": "我还可以选择加一些我想要的东西。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/240_0.wav", "text": "要是片头里有些特定的活儿，想让他干的话。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/241_0.wav", "text": "所以这时候，只要我说“缩放”之类的词。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/242_0.wav", "text": "你就能真的做出缩放效果。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/243_0.wav", "text": "我说：“要加个音效，你就能真的配上一个音效。”"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/244_0.wav", "text": "然后，只要我提到各种动画。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/245_0.wav", "text": "你基本上就能展示三种最拿得出手的动画。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/246_0.wav", "text": "要么是我以前做过的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/247_0.wav", "text": "要么是你从技能库里的素材里特别喜欢的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/248_0.wav", "text": "这些其实就是我给他的指令。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/249_0.wav", "text": "因为我知道自己录好的那张片头。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/250_0.wav", "text": "也想顺便把剪辑技巧展示在片头里。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/251_0.wav", "text": "不过，你几乎可以给他任何质量。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/252_0.wav", "text": "到这一步，我差不多就直接回车了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/253_0.wav", "text": "然后我们来看看克劳德到底能做什么。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/254_0.wav", "text": "运行这个技能，U two剪辑，就像我说的，它会先找到这个技能。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/255_0.wav", "text": "然后就直接开始运行。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/256_0.wav", "text": "正在检测片段，并列出内容。明白吗？"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/257_0.wav", "text": "现在说清楚一点：这段完全是未经剪辑的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/258_0.wav", "text": "所以基本上，我犯了很多错。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/259_0.wav", "text": "我在高潮部分中途停下来，看一眼我的笔记。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/260_0.wav", "text": "它基本上就是把片段切碎，也就是再复制这个片段。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/261_0.wav", "text": "用帕拉吉特把它转录出来。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/262_0.wav", "text": "也就是我们刚才说的那个工具。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/263_0.wav", "text": "它会像我们说的那样，在设置时自动安装。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/264_0.wav", "text": "现在，因为整个过程大概要花十到二十分钟。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/265_0.wav", "text": "我先给你们看看这个钩子的 V V 版本。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/266_0.wav", "text": "视频里所见的一切。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/267_0.wav", "text": "都是我在睡觉时由我的克劳德代码系统剪辑完成的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/268_0.wav", "text": "每一个剪辑，每一个音效，每一个动画，比如这个。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/269_0.wav", "text": "还有这个，或者这个。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/270_0.wav", "text": "全都是在没动时间轴的情况下完成的。不，我不会写代码。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/271_0.wav", "text": "碰，所以你看这段里，我有几处想改的地方。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/272_0.wav", "text": "但基本上已经非常准了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/273_0.wav", "text": "他的意思基本上是把两分四十六秒的原始素材剪成了三十一秒。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/274_0.wav", "text": "这效果简直太棒了！"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/275_0.wav", "text": "然后有几处小地方，对吧？我想再改改。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/276_0.wav", "text": "那我大概会这么说。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/277_0.wav", "text": "第一条修改意见大概是这样的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/278_0.wav", "text": "能麻烦你给这段配上点悬疑音效吗？"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/279_0.wav", "text": "我想让你选一首曲子，加到这个钩子部分。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/280_0.wav", "text": "我一般喜欢把整个片段过一遍。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/281_0.wav", "text": "然后给他加上事件戳，比如。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/282_0.wav", "text": "哦，我看到第二十二秒，这儿是你这么做的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/283_0.wav", "text": "我希望他能做到那样。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/284_0.wav", "text": "从画面到声音，什么都可以。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/285_0.wav", "text": "再到整体的感觉，或者他剪辑的方式。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/286_0.wav", "text": "然后在所有这些弄完之后，我基本上可以告诉他。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/287_0.wav", "text": "能不能麻烦你？你知道的，把这个再稍微改好一点。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/288_0.wav", "text": "当然，最后一步很酷的是，我可以直接说。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/289_0.wav", "text": "嗨，能学学我们刚做的加精技能里吗？"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/290_0.wav", "text": "一次搞定。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/291_0.wav", "text": "视频开头，你看到的就是最终成品。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/292_0.wav", "text": "以前呢，我都是一段一段的弄。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/293_0.wav", "text": "现在嘛，我就直接把所有素材全扔进去。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/294_0.wav", "text": "要是我也在泰拉里路过。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/295_0.wav", "text": "我就会跟他说：“嘿，这些是文件名。”"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/296_0.wav", "text": "因为它能直接访问。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/297_0.wav", "text": "我就不需要上传实际文件了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/298_0.wav", "text": "没错，流程里还是有个人在操作，那个人就是我，而且我还挺喜欢这样。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/299_0.wav", "text": "现在拍完这个之后。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/300_0.wav", "text": "我就把这段原始素材全喂给了克劳德代码。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/301_0.wav", "text": "明天我一醒来。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/302_0.wav", "text": "就能看到跟你屏幕上看到的一模一样的画面。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/303_0.wav", "text": "明天早上，我只要看看提几条意见，就能拿到最终版本了。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/304_0.wav", "text": "所以我是导演，克劳德是剪辑，而我完全不用剪。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/305_0.wav", "text": "这太棒了，因为我根本不会剪辑。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/306_0.wav", "text": "说到这儿，大家都问我成本怎么样。那咱们就具体到每块钱算算。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/307_0.wav", "text": "首先，我用的是克劳德，是最高套餐，一个月要花二零零美元。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/308_0.wav", "text": "这是固定费用，但我其实所有工作都用它，不只是剪视频。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/309_0.wav", "text": "所以我让克劳德具体统计了一下，他用了多少头啃。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/310_0.wav", "text": "我每个月是有 token 数量上限的。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/311_0.wav", "text": "算下来，我上一个视频的制作成本是二十四美元。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/312_0.wav", "text": "这还是最多。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/313_0.wav", "text": "最棒的是，海珀真和帕拉吉特都完全免费，所以这部分不用花钱。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/314_0.wav", "text": "泰勒，我用的是年付方案，每月十三美元，和每个视频大概二美元。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/315_0.wav", "text": "IP代米克桑德是我所有音效和音乐的来源，花了九点九九美元。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/316_0.wav", "text": "同样，我用的是年付方案，那就再加一美元吧。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/317_0.wav", "text": "所以总共算下来，每个视频差不多要花二十七美元。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/318_0.wav", "text": "但现实是，找优兔剪辑师的话，一个靠谱的剪辑师，每个视频要价两百五十到一千多美元。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/319_0.wav", "text": "也就是说，每个视频我能省下几百美元。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/320_0.wav", "text": "但对我来说，最大的好处其实是执行速度。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/321_0.wav", "text": "现在我当天就能策划、拍摄、剪辑并发布视频。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/322_0.wav", "text": "以前呢，我得花三到七天，具体看跟哪个剪辑师合作。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/323_0.wav", "text": "而且改来改去，总是反反复复。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/324_0.wav", "text": "还因为人为失误，我常的重做那些我明明已经看过。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/325_0.wav", "text": "但上下个视频里根本没改动的地方。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/326_0.wav", "text": "现在我可不想让你们也遭我受过的罪。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/327_0.wav", "text": "所以我会在我的免费社群里免费教你们这项技能。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/328_0.wav", "text": "它叫维亚诺寇德，链接就在下面。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/329_0.wav", "text": "想看看这项剪辑技能在完整视频里的实际运用。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/330_0.wav", "text": "还想详细了解 Open AI 开发日都公布了哪些内容？"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/331_0.wav", "text": "可以看看这个视频。"}, {"audio": "/Users/vanch/VideoLingo-plus/run_workspaces/20261018-231604-5b8636/output/audio/segs/332_0.wav", "text": "希望你们喜欢这个视频。我们下个视频见，走起。"}]
